    "scope": "8.g.W implements actual read-only impact through Python, CLI, structured requests and the portable zipapp. A complete current artifact inventory includes all relation-review history. Every directly stored incoming/outgoing relation is grouped by original type, retaining relation identity, both endpoints, physical direction and neighbour existence. Appendix J observations provide separate unreviewed/current/suspect/invalid groups with affected IDs, exact reasons and selected/matching/historical review IDs. Structural invalid bindings and current rejections remain visible; direct invalid yields exit 1 with a complete result and SRV027/error. Unreviewed/suspect use Core warning defaults; effective profile policy is explicitly not claimed. Malformed inventory/review fields abort rather than publish partial results. Unrelated structural invalidity is outside the direct assessment, but all bytes/membership/configuration remain bound and are rechecked before completion. No normative write, cache, lock, inferred priority, invented verification, authenticated-review claim, full semantic approval or atomic snapshot is added. The W baseline materializes inventory and output. R adds artifact_observations for exactly the start and all direct endpoints. Stored priority and verification_plan_status remain literal values; absent fields and absent artifacts are explicitly missing and unavailable, respectively. Missing targets have no inferred artifact type. Every row declares verification_assessment=not_performed; workflow, text, extensions, waivers and current relation reviews never become a computed verification result. The existing result family and catalog metadata use minor version 1.1.0. Independent oracles cover every allowed priority/workflow value, invalid fields, ordering, passive malformed/stale/symlink caches, corrupt normative sources, concurrent projection changes, ownership, CLI parity and schema closure. All old test files and 9197 old IDs remain unchanged. C planner sharing, remaining report consumers, durable Work, external delivery, effective profiles, alternate bases and platform/performance acceptance remain open; materialized input/output and existing read-only/currentness boundaries remain explicit."
